---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config";

const analyticsOn = Boolean(site.analytics.cloudflareToken);

const email = site.contactEmail;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description={`How ${site.name} handles your files and data. Files are processed in your browser and are never uploaded.`}
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy"
>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page__intro">
        <p class="micro">Privacy</p>
        <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          The short version: your files are processed on your device and are
          never uploaded. We do not ask for an account or an email address.
        </p>
        <p class="tool-note">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          “We” means {site.name}, operated by {site.maker} in {site.location}.
          You can reach us at <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Your files</h2>
        <p>
          The tools on this site are built to open files using code that runs in
          your browser. The file contents are not sent to this website or to
          any other server as part of the tool. You can check this yourself
          with your browser's developer tools (Network tab). Not every tool is
          live yet; each tool page says whether it is ready.
        </p>
        <p>
          Files you download are created by your own browser. We never receive a
          copy, so we cannot see, store, recover or share them.
        </p>

        <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We do not require an account, name, email address or phone number.</li>
          <li>We do not upload or store the files you process.</li>
          <li>We do not sell personal information.</li>
          <li>We do not use advertising cookies on this site at the moment.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Local storage</h2>
        <p>
          If you switch between light and dark mode, your choice is saved in
          your browser's local storage. It stays on your device, is not sent to
          us, and you can clear it at any time in your browser settings.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        {analyticsOn ? (
          <p>
            This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics, a privacy-friendly
            analytics service that does not use cookies and does not build a
            profile of you. It reports general information such as page views,
            country and device type in aggregate. It does not receive the
            contents of your files.
          </p>
        ) : (
          <p>
            This site does not use analytics at the moment, and no analytics
            script is loaded. If that changes, this section will be updated
            first.
          </p>
        )}

        <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
        <p>
          The site is hosted by a static hosting provider. Like most hosting
          providers, it may keep basic technical logs such as the requested
          page, time, browser type and IP address for security and reliability.
          Those logs do not contain the contents of the files you process.
        </p>

        <h2>Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          This site does not show ads at the moment. If advertising is added
          later, it will be limited to normal banner or native ads. Advertising
          partners such as Google may use cookies or similar technologies to
          show and measure ads.
        </p>
        <p>
          Where required, a consent banner will ask for your permission before
          advertising cookies are used, especially for visitors in the European
          Union and the United Kingdom. You will be able to change or withdraw
          that choice.
        </p>
        <p>
          To learn about Google's use of advertising data, see{" "}
          <a
            href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank">Google's advertising policies</a
          >. You can manage personalised ads at{" "}
          <a
            href="https://adssettings.google.com"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a
          >, and opt out of participating companies at{" "}
          <a
            href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank">aboutads.info</a
          >.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party code</h2>
        <p>
          Some tools may load open-source code libraries from a content delivery
          network (CDN) instead of this site. That request downloads code, not
          your files. The CDN can see standard technical information such as
          your IP address and browser version, but never the contents of a file
          you open.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is a general-purpose tool site and is not directed at
          children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information
          from children.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Check for yourself that nothing is uploaded, using your browser's developer tools (Network tab).</li>
          <li>Clear local storage in your browser to remove the theme choice.</li>
          <li>Use an ad or tracker blocker if you prefer.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes, the date at the top of the page will be
          updated. Significant changes will be described in plain language.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about privacy can be sent to{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
